OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers lingering otherwise dry with
OL,7,Fclear spells, feeling quite chilly.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier later in the evening
OL,9,Fwith rain spreading northeast later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA wet start for most areas,
OL,13,Frain heavy and persistent for a time,
OL,14,Fparticularly in the southeast. Rain
OL,15,Flighter for western areas by mid-
OL,16,Fafternoon and likely a dry evening
OL,17,Fhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
