OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend, rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds spread east on Saturday
OL,8,Fturning showery later and through
OL,9,FSunday but accompanied by severe
OL,10,Fgales. Dry start Monday, unsettled
OL,11,Fagain later.
